    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433090/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1615068400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433090/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1615068400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433090/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1615068400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In this visual novel you're a voice in a schizophrenic heads of dynasty M\u00fcller. You pass from generation to generation and you control your schizophrenic, talking sometimes with him. The important thing is, you shouldn't let your schizophrenic die without offspring, otherwise you'll die with him.<br><br><br><strong>That's why this game is so beautiful:</strong><br><br>\u2714You're a voice in a schizophrenic's head;<br>\u2714<strong>ABSOLUTELY EVERY</strong> decision you make matters;<br>\u2714Original story;<br>\u2714A lot of references to <u>history, art, psychology, philosophy </u>.<br>\u2714You'll get to see completely <u>different historical epochs</u>;<br>\u2714Black-and-white style;<br>\u2714Intellectual game;<br>\u2714New stories after every big update!!!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433090/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1615068400\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433090/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1615068400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433090/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1615068400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In this visual novel you're a voice in a schizophrenic heads of dynasty M\u00fcller. You pass from generation to generation and you control your schizophrenic, talking sometimes with him. The important thing is, you shouldn't let your schizophrenic die without offspring, otherwise you'll die with him.<br><br><br><strong>That's why this game is so beautiful:</strong><br><br>\u2714You're a voice in a schizophrenic's head;<br>\u2714<strong>ABSOLUTELY EVERY</strong> decision you make matters;<br>\u2714Original story;<br>\u2714A lot of references to <u>history, art, psychology, philosophy </u>.<br>\u2714You'll get to see completely <u>different historical epochs</u>;<br>\u2714Black-and-white style;<br>\u2714Intellectual game;<br>\u2714New stories after every big update!!!",
